## Known gaps

Entries whose cited papers never name the panel genes in their own text — the citations are papers about the cell type, so the trail stops at the label rather than the marker:

- `cl56_v15::S cone cell` — 19 papers, none stating AIPL1, ATF6, C2, CEP290, CNGB1, CRB1, DAB1, EYS

Entries that carry no marker panel at all in their source library — nothing can be checked against a paper's text until a panel is recorded, so their citations stay at the label level:

- `face_v6::Fibroblast` — 20 papers, 0 markers recorded in `kb/markers/markers_v6_face_increment.json`
- `face_v6::Myofibroblast` — 20 papers, 0 markers recorded in `kb/markers/markers_v6_face_increment.json`

